# Tracked and intentional, despite looking like agent config:
#   .agents/  .claude/   repository-local rules; NEVER linked by setup.ps1
#   docs/                human-facing guidance
# Only .plans/ is ignored. It is the FALLBACK location for planning documents when
# the shared hyvanmielenpelit/plans repository cannot be reached -- not their home.
# Ignoring it matters more, not less: a fallback document is one that has not
# reached anyone yet, and committing it here would be the wrong fix.

.vs/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
scratch/
tmp/
.plans/
__pycache__/
